{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>עלה</b> — If one of the sheep breaks through and goes out first, they all break through and go out one after another, and so Israel do with the words of the false prophet, like sheep that go to pasture." "<b>ויעבור מלכם</b> — And the glory of HaShem first; therefore it is written: כה אמר ה' על הנביאים המתעים שאמרו אסוף אאסוף (thus said YHWH concerning the prophets who lead astray, who say 'I will surely gather')."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:45.490883080Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}